# symlinks to the XMage dist's card database (see docs/.../deck-import-formats).
# Two: CardDb's relative JDBC URL (./db/cards.h2) must resolve both when the
# bridge runs from the repo root (mvn -Prun/-Pspike/-Pharness, which set
# workingDirectory explicitly) and when surefire runs the live test tier,
# whose default forked-JVM cwd is the bridge/ module dir, not the repo root.
/db
/bridge/db
